{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <i>&quot;What do books mean to us? And what happens when the stories we depend on go missing?&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Library Investigation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Play as Ruby (they/them), a journalism major on a surreal, after-hours adventure to investigate the disappearance of books from their college library. Their quest for library justice leads to dark political revelations and a magnetic connection with a mysterious trans librarian. Can Ruby live out their own queer story, even as queer history is being erased?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551960/extras/sliding_shelf.gif?t=1741709159\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Narrative Puzzling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thought bubbles</strong> provide insight into Ruby's (sometimes scattered) mind, as you make your way through the mysterious MacLeod library. Use an\u00a0<strong>interactive</strong>\u00a0<strong>journal</strong> to focus these thoughts and reveal new insights. The more you learn about Ruby's past, and the queer history of MacLeod itself, the more of the library's secrets you'll unlock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551960/extras/bedroom_bubbles.gif?t=1741709159\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>poignant</strong>, timely tale, which intertwines the <strong>personal</strong> &amp; the <strong>political</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a <strong>labyrinthine library</strong>, with hundreds of real-world books</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>MetroidBrainia,</strong> where knowledge &amp; insight advance the gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Psychological mechanics</strong>\u00a0allow you to experience the world through Ruby\u2019s eyes</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3551960?t=1741709159","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551960/259dccafc233256d34db9e1e2c99a39f5fceebf8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741709159","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551960/be03b569a713401918852043dec7ccc08fbd630a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741709159","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551960/be03b569a713401918852043dec7ccc08fbd630a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741709159","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <i>&quot;What do books mean to us? And what happens when the stories we depend on go missing?&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Library Investigation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Play as Ruby (they/them), a journalism major on a surreal, after-hours adventure to investigate the disappearance of books from their college library. Their quest for library justice leads to dark political revelations and a magnetic connection with a mysterious trans librarian. Can Ruby live out their own queer story, even as queer history is being erased?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551960/extras/sliding_shelf.gif?t=1741709159\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Narrative Puzzling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thought bubbles</strong> provide insight into Ruby's (sometimes scattered) mind, as you make your way through the mysterious MacLeod library. Use an\u00a0<strong>interactive</strong>\u00a0<strong>journal</strong> to focus these thoughts and reveal new insights. The more you learn about Ruby's past, and the queer history of MacLeod itself, the more of the library's secrets you